{"t": "20:36:17", "kind": "question", "slot": "dyn:danger_signs.breathing_difficulty+danger_signs.heavy_bleeding+complaint.category+complaint.text", "text": "I'm glad he's awake. Is he having any trouble breathing or is there any heavy bleeding? Also, could you tell me what the main problem is and what's happening?", "fields": ["danger_signs.breathing_difficulty", "danger_signs.heavy_bleeding", "complaint.category", "complaint.text"], "offered": ["danger_signs.breathing_difficulty", "danger_signs.heavy_bleeding", "complaint.category", "complaint.text", "complaint.onset", "E.mechanism"]}
{"t": "20:36:17", "kind": "answer", "slot": "dyn:danger_signs.breathing_difficulty+danger_signs.heavy_bleeding+complaint.category+complaint.text", "text": "No, he's breathing fine. No bleeding. He fell down 4 steps at home and landed on his right hip. He can't stand."}
